(kicad_sch
	(version 20260306)
	(generator "eeschema")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(uuid "a4774022-41d4-4be7-85b6-fed5477a3f9f")
	(paper "A2")
	(title_block
		(title "CEC 24-pin ATX Module")
		(date "2026-07-03")
		(rev "BETA-2")
		(company "CEC")
		(comment 1 "BETA-1 (beta schematic wave, K2 ruling): J6 mezzanine pin-map reconciliation (design doc corrected to match the as-built rev3/hub-rev2 pair, no schematic re-pin -- K1 gate CLOSED); RS4 5VSB shunt -> true 4-terminal Kelvin land (CEC_SHUNT_4T + Vishay WSK2512 footprint, B4); H3/H3a standalone-mode suite (USBLC6-2SC6 ESD, VBUS clamp, VBUS bead populated, +5V_SYS port-entry bead 0R-default, CAN CMC position DNP + parallel 0R bypass); output-form (J4) marked WORKING BASIS pending the D-5a ruling; discovered+fixed a pre-existing J2 net defect (Hub-power JST was still on the stale +5VSB input, not the mux's +5V_SYS output). See docs/standard-tier-review/beta-splices/atx-24pin.md.")
		(comment 2 "BETA-2 (spec Sec 2.8 v1.4.0 output-architecture revision, owner-ratified 2026-07-04): J4 (Mini-Fit Jr 24-ckt output header) DELETED -- retires the two-male-header output form and its female-to-female bridging-cable premise. Output rails now cross the ratified connector-daughterboard interface: 9 Keystone 3586 SMT universal-entry blade clips (TB1-TB9, LCSC C238113, one per ratified joint -- 12Vx1/5Vx2/3.3Vx1/5VSBx1/GNDx4), each single-pin clip landing on the SAME post-shunt rail node J4 used to carry, plus one 2x5 2.54mm signal header (J_SIG) carrying the flat J4 signal set (PS_ON#/PWR_OK/-12V) + a local GND reference, pins 5-10 reserved. Sense-return contacts NOT added (owner decision box (e) still open). Mating daughterboard (TE 63849-1 tabs) is a separate, not-yet-created deliverable -- see docs/standard-tier-review/output-daughterboard-study-2026-07-04.md and blade-fit-check-2026-07-04.md.")
	)
